# TEN TACLES BD — COMPLETE WHOLESALE FASHION E-COMMERCE WEBSITE

Act as a senior UI/UX designer, full-stack developer, and e-commerce architect. Build a premium, responsive, functional wholesale clothing e-commerce website for **TEN TACLES BD**, a Bangladesh-based wholesale clothing business.

The website must closely follow the visual design, layout, product presentation, and shopping experience of the uploaded Dorjibari.com.bd reference screenshots, while using Ten Tacles BD branding and wholesale-specific ordering functionality.

Do not build a generic template or a static landing page. Build a complete, cohesive website with reusable components, functional interactions, a wholesale ordering system, product catalogues, cart, checkout or order request flow, and backend readiness.

